<section class="trust">
  <div class="container inner">
    <div class="copy">
      <h2>Your traffic stays between your machines.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Nearhost has no relay, no account and no public hostname. Your <code>.test</code> names
        resolve from a marked block in <code>/etc/hosts</code> that Nearhost owns, and requests
        travel over your own SSH connection to the server.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span>Runs in the foreground. Quit it and the tunnels close.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span>One sudo prompt per hosts change, and it tells you why first.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
          <span>
            <code>nearhost untrust</code> and <code>hosts clean</code> undo the keychain and hosts
            changes.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <pre class="hosts"><span class="faint"># /etc/hosts</span>

<span class="dim">127.0.0.1   localhost
::1         localhost
…</span>

<span class="marker"># nearhost:start</span>
<span class="entry">127.0.0.1   myapp.test
127.0.0.1   website.test
127.0.0.1   otherapp.test</span>
<span class="marker"># nearhost:end</span></pre>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .trust {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--nh-line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--nh-ground) 92%, var(--nh-surface));
  }
  .inner {
    padding-block: 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .copy {
    flex: 1 1 380px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--nh-font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: var(--nh-track-display);
  }
  .lede {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--nh-body);
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  code {
    font-family: var(--nh-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--nh-body);
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .arrow {
    color: var(--nh-accent);
    font-family: var(--nh-font-mono);
  }
  .hosts {
    flex: 1 1 380px;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--nh-ground) 85%, black);
    border: 1px solid var(--nh-line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    font-family: var(--nh-font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--nh-muted);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .hosts .faint {
    color: var(--nh-faint);
  }
  .hosts .dim {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--nh-faint) 60%, var(--nh-ground));
  }
  .hosts .marker {
